## Original Content
Alors que les candidats devront se déclarer entre le 1er et le 15 septembre, quatre figures ont déjà annoncé qu’ils souhaitaient participer : Raphaël Glucksmann, les socialistes Philippe Brun et Jérôme Guedj, ainsi que l’ex-candidate à la présidentielle Ségolène Royal.

## Summary
The Socialist Party and Place publique have validated an agreement for their joint primary election in October, which will include two rounds, a participation fee of 10-15 euros, and electronic voting. Candidates must declare their candidacy between September 1st and 15th, with four notable figures already announced.

## Key Points
- Agreement finalized between Socialist Party and Place publique for the October primary.
- Primary details: two rounds, electronic voting, and a fee of 10-15 euros.
- Candidacy declaration period is from September 1st to 15th.
- Prominent candidates include Raphaël Glucksmann, Philippe Brun, Jérôme Guedj, and Ségolène Royal.


